CHAPTER.VERS:
Hearken not to Hezekiah: for thus saith the king of Assyria, Make 
 with me  a present, and come out to me: and eat ye every one of his vine, and every one of his fig tree, and drink ye every one the waters of his own cistern; 

  Make…: or, Seek my favour by a present: Heb. Make with me a blessing
